3
00:03:45,314 --> 00:03:50,814
……割とレベルの高い合格点を越える生誕祭をオールウェイズ出してくれる
…She always puts out a birthday stream that reliably clears a pretty high passing bar.

4
00:03:51,914 --> 00:03:53,074
どこから来たんですか？
Where did you come from?

5
00:03:53,654 --> 00:03:55,774
えっと……スト6の方から
Um… from Street Fighter 6.

6
00:03:55,974 --> 00:03:57,654
ありがとうございます
Thank you very much.

7
00:03:59,049 --> 00:04:00,519
開会してんでしょ？
It's already started, right?

8
00:04:00,519 --> 00:04:01,359
閉会しています！
It's closed!

9
00:04:01,359 --> 00:04:02,579
開会してんでしょ？
It's started, right?

10
00:04:02,579 --> 00:04:03,499
閉会しています！
It's closed!

11
00:04:03,739 --> 00:04:05,419
さっき開会してるって言ったじゃん
You just said it started!

12
00:04:05,359 --> 00:04:06,599
閉会しています！
It's closed!

13
00:04:06,879 --> 00:04:11,179
ラプラス・ダークネスの生誕祭は……閉会しています！
Laplus Darkness's birthday stream is... closed!

14
00:04:20,100 --> 00:04:26,100
みんなー！吾輩の誕生日ライブに来てくれてありがとねー！
Everyone~! Thanks so much for coming to my birthday live~!

15
00:04:26,400 --> 00:04:29,000
まずは1曲目！夜行性ハイズ！
First song! Nocturnal Haze!

16
00:04:29,200 --> 00:04:31,000
いくぞー！
Let's go!

17
00:04:33,430 --> 00:04:37,430
片付けたい 忘れていたい そんな顔でいつまで戦うの
Wanting to tidy up, wanting to forget—with that kind of face, how long will you keep fighting

18
00:04:37,430 --> 00:04:40,430
また一人で
all alone again...

19
00:04:40,910 --> 00:04:47,310
愛しても 愛しても その度に傷口が顔を出す 巻き戻すように
Love after love, every time wounds show their face, like rewinding time.

20
00:04:47,930 --> 00:04:54,630
どうして1から10まで更には100まで呑み込む悲しみだけは 亡くなってくれないの?
Why can't the sadness that swallows everything from 1 to 10, and even up to 100, just disappear?

21
00:04:54,930 --> 00:05:00,008
総じて逃げ場もないのに-100から始まる動悸の日々も 匿ってくれないや
Even though there's nowhere to run, the days of palpitations starting from -100 won't shelter me either.

22
00:05:00,328 --> 00:05:01,838
眠たいが寝ない
I'm sleepy yet awake.

23
00:05:02,588 --> 00:05:03,958
ちゃんと泣いて
Cry properly,

24
00:05:03,958 --> 00:05:08,968
無理もしたら ここへおいでよ いつだって
and push yourself too hard, come right here anytime.

25
00:05:09,438 --> 00:05:12,728
これからを沸かせようか
Let's heat up what's to come!

26
00:05:14,938 --> 00:05:21,438
眠たいが寝ない まだ今日が良い 僕ら何度だって思い合って 光っていくんだよ
I'm sleepy yet awake, today is still good. No matter how many times, we care for each other and shine on.

27
00:05:22,038 --> 00:05:25,568
消せない最低は 理想じゃない
The worst we can't erase isn't an ideal.

28
00:05:25,568 --> 00:05:29,008
なんかハイなシャイがちょうどいいや 救っていたいのさ
A kind of high shyness is just right, I want to save you.

29
00:05:29,838 --> 00:05:32,488
「死にたい」「消えたい」も 異常じゃない
"I want to die" or "I want to disappear" isn't abnormal either.

30
00:05:32,488 --> 00:05:35,808
よしよしのシーで秘密会議 ほら吐き出しちゃおう
With a comforting "there, there" secret meeting, come on, let it all out.

31
00:05:36,438 --> 00:05:39,908
君は泣いたって 綺麗だよ
You're beautiful even when you cry.

32
00:05:39,908 --> 00:05:43,908
さらばアンチビート 前を向いて 笑っていこうじゃない もう
Farewell, anti-beat, face forward and let's just laugh, already.

33
00:05:51,568 --> 00:05:57,608
寂しくない 悲しくない 塗り重ねた強がり 深い青 洗い流せたら
Not lonely, not sad, if we could wash away the layered bravado and deep blue.

34
00:05:58,838 --> 00:06:04,608
バイバイを バイバイを バカみたいな世界にありがとう 探さないでね
Bye-bye, bye-bye, thank you to this foolish world, don't go looking for me.

35
00:06:06,338 --> 00:06:12,728
そうして僕らは広くも狭くも熱くも寒くもないこの部屋で 抱き合って息するの
And so, in this room that's neither wide nor narrow, hot nor cold, we embrace and breathe together.

36
00:06:13,238 --> 00:06:20,568
常識はずれを外れて 二人だけの愛言葉で鍵をかけたら さあどんな夜行をしようか
Stepping out of common sense, locking it with just our secret password for two, come on, what kind of night journey shall we take?

37
00:06:35,538 --> 00:06:41,728
だけど痛い だから痛い 優しさが沁み込んでいく 消毒を始めようか
But it hurts, so it hurts, kindness is soaking in. Shall we begin disinfection?

38
00:06:47,338 --> 00:06:54,438
声を何度だって送りあって 保ってきましたが やめよう 逃げよう 大丈夫だよ
We kept sending our voices to each other and held on, but let's stop, let's run away, it's going to be okay.

39
00:06:55,538 --> 00:07:01,328
もう寝たっていいの ちゃんと僕が 守ってあげるから 「おはよう」をしよう また「今日」にしよう
You can sleep now, I will protect you properly. Let's say "good morning" and make it "today" once again.

40
00:07:01,838 --> 00:07:08,568
よしよしのシーで秘密会議 ほら吐き出しちゃおう 僕も泣いちゃって やばいから
With a comforting "there, there" secret meeting, come on, let it out. I'm about to cry too and it's dangerous,

41
00:07:11,838 --> 00:07:16,868
さらばアンチビート 前を向いて 笑っていこうじゃない
farewell, anti-beat, face forward and let's just laugh.

42
00:07:17,338 --> 00:07:21,008
弱虫な僕達は
We cowardly ones

43
00:07:21,008 --> 00:07:25,728
変わっても変わってない 終わらない 今日もハイズ
haven't changed even if we change, and today's Highs never end.

44
00:07:26,338 --> 00:07:30,728
光っていく 光っていく
Shining on, shining on,

45
00:07:31,008 --> 00:07:34,908
ツライのは ツライけど
even though it's painful,

46
00:07:34,908 --> 00:07:40,438
二人で乗り越えるさ
we'll overcome it together.

47
00:08:07,838 --> 00:08:12,728
今回、ラプラスさんの生誕祭があるらしいんですけど、
I heard there's a birthday event for Laplus-san coming up...

48
00:08:13,438 --> 00:08:14,608
え、マジですか？
Eh, seriously?!

49
00:08:14,838 --> 00:08:17,438
あの、え、ラプラスさんてあのホロライブの？
Um, wait, Laplus-san, from Hololive?!

50
00:08:17,938 --> 00:08:20,938
僕、あのーあれ、待ち受けにしてるんですよ。
I actually, you know, have her as my phone wallpaper.

51
00:08:21,338 --> 00:08:26,568
しかも今回の話す曲が、ラプラスバースデイ2025らしくて、
And I heard the song for this time is for 'Laplus Birthday 2025,' and...

52
00:08:27,238 --> 00:08:29,238
え、マジでショックです。
Eh, I'm seriously shocked.

53
00:08:29,838 --> 00:08:33,728
でも幸せならOKです。
But, well, as long as she's happy, it's okay!

54
00:08:42,338 --> 00:08:47,438
ねぇ あたしのことが好きなら 気付いて 気付いて 気付いて 気付いて
Hey, if you like me, notice me, notice me, notice me, notice me!

55
00:08:47,838 --> 00:08:49,728
夢を見せてよ
Show me a dream!

56
00:08:49,838 --> 00:08:55,608
どうしてわかってくれないの？ 嫌いだ 嫌いだ 嫌いだ 嫌いだ 二度と触れないで
Why won't you understand me? I hate you, I hate you, I hate you, I hate you. Don't ever touch me again.

57
00:09:09,938 --> 00:09:15,568
ちょっと待って どこからおかしくなったの ダメなとこも好きになれて よかったのに
Wait a minute, where did things go wrong? It was nice being able to love even your flaws,

58
00:09:15,838 --> 00:09:22,728
ぱーっと飲んで 誰かに埋めてもらえたら あなたのこと 忘れられると思っていた
thinking if I drank wildly and had someone else fill the void, I could forget all about you.

59
00:09:23,238 --> 00:09:28,968
トモダチってさ 都合よくない？ けど繋がってるなら悪くはないね
Aren't friends awfully convenient? But being connected isn't so bad,

60
00:09:29,008 --> 00:09:33,808
騙し騙し生きて 病んじゃって 優しくされると余計にツライ けど冷たくされるの望んでないよ
Living deceitfully, falling sick, being treated kindly hurts even more, but I don't want you to be cold to me either.

61
00:09:34,238 --> 00:09:38,238
あたしだけでいいよって 信じちゃって
Believing "just me is enough,"

62
00:09:38,838 --> 00:09:39,908
ばかだ
how foolish of me.

63
00:09:41,338 --> 00:09:46,728
ねぇ あたしのことが好きなら 気付いて 気付いて 気付いて 気付いて
Hey, if you like me, notice me, notice me, notice me, notice me!

64
00:09:47,238 --> 00:09:49,328
夢を見せてよ
Show me a dream!

65
00:09:49,438 --> 00:09:55,568
どうしてわかってくれないの？ 嫌いだ 嫌いだ 嫌いだ 嫌いだ 二度と触れないで
Why won't you understand me? I hate you, I hate you, I hate you, I hate you. Don't ever touch me again.

66
00:09:56,238 --> 00:09:59,238
ダサい感情は1 2の散で流れ星 あの子とのコト呪ってあげるわ
Lame emotions become shooting stars in 1, 2, 3. I'll curse you and that girl.

67
00:10:00,236 --> 00:10:02,176
ねぇ あたしのことが好きなら
Hey, if you love me...

68
00:10:02,176 --> 00:10:08,216
気付いて 気付いて 気付いて 気付いて 夢を見せてよ どうしてわかってくれないの 嫌いだ 嫌いだ 嫌いだ 嫌いだ 二度と触れないで
Notice me, notice me, notice me, notice me, show me a dream! Why won't you understand? I hate you, I hate you, I hate you, I hate you, don't ever touch me again!

69
00:10:08,516 --> 00:10:11,216
でもまだ好きだよ
But I still love you...

70
00:10:24,016 --> 00:10:30,516
「吸って吐いて そうちゃんと生きて」 鼓膜舐める愛のCoda 溶かし尽くす煙るソーダ
"Inhale, exhale, live properly." Love's coda licking your eardrums, a smoking soda dissolving everything...

71
00:10:31,016 --> 00:10:37,016
ねぇ 置いていかないで ねえ お腹空いた 見て見ぬ振り 唾を吐いて 燃えないごみにするんだ？
Hey, don't leave me behind. Hey, I'm hungry. Turning a blind eye and spitting, turning you into non-burnable trash?

72
00:10:44,016 --> 00:10:50,016
ねぇ あたしのことが好きなら 気付いて 気付いて 気付いて 気付いて 夢を見せてよ
Hey, if you love me, notice me, notice me, notice me, notice me, show me a dream!

73
00:10:50,516 --> 00:10:58,016
どうしてわかってくれないの？ 嫌いだ 嫌いだ 嫌いだ 嫌いだ 大嫌いだ もうあなたは振り向かないの 気付いてる 気付いてる
Why won't you understand? I hate you, I hate you, I hate you, I hate you, I totally hate you! You're not turning back anymore, and I know it, I know it...

74
00:10:59,016 --> 00:11:06,516
気付いてる 気付いてるくせにあたしは 「どうして」ばっか 変われないの
Even though you know it, I'm stuck asking "why" and can't change...

75
00:11:07,016 --> 00:11:11,516
したいよ したいよ したいよ したいよ 離れたくないよ
I want to, I want to, I want to, I want to—I don't want to be apart!

76
00:11:12,216 --> 00:11:19,016
ダサい感情は1 2の散で流れ星 あの子とのコト 祝ってあげるわ
Uncool emotions become a shooting star in 1, 2, scatter—I'll even celebrate you and that girl...

77
00:11:19,016 --> 00:11:28,016
ねぇ 最期にぎゅっとさせてほしい ありがとう ありがとう ありがとう ありがとう これであなたも...
Hey, let me hold you tight one last time. Thank you, thank you, thank you, thank you—now you too...

78
00:11:33,742 --> 00:11:37,742
次のラプラスさんの曲、アンドロイドガールらしいんですけど
I heard Laplus-san's next song is "Android Girl", but...

79
00:11:38,242 --> 00:11:39,542
え、何すか？
Huh, what's that?

80
00:11:40,842 --> 00:11:43,342
それは許せないと思います、これ。
I think that's unforgivable, honestly.

81
00:11:44,242 --> 00:11:46,142
「テメェらバカかよ！」ってのが第一ですね。
The first thing is, "Are you guys idiots?!"

82
00:11:46,942 --> 00:11:50,542
ラプラスといえば、まあ"アイドル"みたいなもんですからね。
When you think of Laplus, she's basically an "idol", right?

83
00:11:50,942 --> 00:11:56,542
それはちょっとね、まあ世間は許してくれませんよ。
That's a bit... well, society won't forgive that.

84
00:12:22,516 --> 00:12:27,516
もういっそ "一緒ランド" 作りましょ 君とマッチアップ 乗っかって
Let's just build "Together Land" right now, match up and ride along with you!

85
00:12:27,516 --> 00:12:30,016
「構ってもっと 足りないの」
"Pay more attention to me, it's not enough!"

86
00:12:30,016 --> 00:12:32,816
歌え 想い出染みた嫉妬の style
Sing it, a style of jealousy steeped in memories.

87
00:12:33,216 --> 00:12:38,516
代わる代わる傷付けては 「もうしない」って嘘で仲直りごっこだ 勘違いの騙し合い
Hurting each other in turns, playing make-believe makeup games with the lie "I won't do it again"—a mutual deception of misunderstandings.

88
00:12:39,816 --> 00:12:45,016
目を見ればすぐに分かるってバカみたい "妄想" に好きって言うほど この愛は腐ってるんだよ
How foolish to think looking into my eyes makes you understand right away—this love is so rotten that calling it "love" in a "delusion" is sickening.

89
00:12:46,016 --> 00:12:52,016
早く気付いてくれよ アンドロイドガール をかしくなっちゃった 僕だけのものになった君は "誰" なの?
Hurry up and notice, Android Girl, I've gone crazy. You became mine alone, but who are you?

90
00:12:52,016 --> 00:12:55,016
ずっとずっと
Always, always...

91
00:13:00,016 --> 00:13:07,516
信じてきたのにな アンドロイドガール 想いはなんだっけ 君とのキスが痛くて息を閉じたの
Even though I've believed in you all this time, Android Girl, what was that feeling again? Your kiss hurt so much that I stopped breathing.

92
00:13:07,516 --> 00:13:15,016
ずっとずっと 何度愛を再起動したって ちょっとだって変われなどしないよ
Always, always—no matter how many times I rebooted love, it wouldn't change even a little bit.

93
00:13:26,516 --> 00:13:32,016
「あぁ 可愛いね どうしてくれよう」 もう疲れた ドキドキさせるお世辞の resize
"Ah, so cute, what should I do with you?" I'm already tired of flattering resizes that make my heart race.

94
00:13:36,016 --> 00:13:41,516
鬱雑い鬱雑いの併合罪 どう期待していいのか分からなくなったよ エンドロールはまだですか
A combined crime of overwhelming annoyance—I don't know how to expect anything anymore. Are the end credits still not here?

95
00:13:41,516 --> 00:13:45,016
どこにいても一緒だなんてまじで痛い
Saying we're together no matter where we are is seriously pathetic.

96
00:13:46,016 --> 00:13:52,016
"感傷"に浸っていいかな あの頃を願っていいかな アリかナシか教えてよ
Can I soak in sentimentality? Can I wish for those days? Tell me whether it's a yes or no.

97
00:13:54,016 --> 00:14:00,016
アンドロイドガール をかしくなっちゃった 僕だけのものになった君は "誰" なの?
Android Girl, I've gone crazy. You became mine alone, but who are you?

98
00:14:00,016 --> 00:14:04,516
ずっとずっと 騙してきたんだね
You've been deceiving me all along, haven't you?

99
00:14:05,016 --> 00:14:10,516
アンドロイドガール 想いはなんだっけ 錆び憑いた腕で何度僕を求めた?
Android Girl, what was that feeling? How many times did you reach for me with rusted arms?

100
00:14:11,016 --> 00:14:17,516
ずっとずっと 何度愛を再起動したって ちょっとだって変われなどしないよ
Always, always—no matter how many times I rebooted love, it wouldn't change even a little bit.

101
00:14:34,516 --> 00:14:44,516
アンドロイドガール をかしくなっちゃった 僕だけのものになった君は "誰" なの? ずっとずっと信じてきたのにな
Android Girl, I've gone crazy. You became mine alone, but who are you? Even though I've always believed in you...

102
00:14:45,016 --> 00:14:52,016
アンドロイドガール 想いはなんだっけ 君とのキスが痛くて息を閉じたの ずっとずっと 我儘が離れない
Android Girl, what was that feeling? Your kiss hurt so much that I stopped breathing. Always, always, my selfishness won't leave me.

103
00:14:55,016 --> 00:15:00,016
君だけは許さない アンドロイドガール をかしくなっちゃった
I won't forgive you alone. Android Girl, I've gone crazy...

104
00:15:00,340 --> 00:15:02,220
君だけのものになった "僕" が好きなの?
Have I become yours alone? Do you love me?

105
00:15:02,220 --> 00:15:06,160
ずっとずっと騙してきたんだね
You've been deceiving me all this time...

106
00:15:07,160 --> 00:15:10,080
アンドロイドガール 想いはなんだっけ
Android Girl, what were those feelings again?

107
00:15:10,080 --> 00:15:13,220
錆び憑いた腕で何度僕を求めた?
With rusted arms, how many times did you seek me out?

108
00:15:13,220 --> 00:15:17,420
ずっとずっと 何度愛を再起動したって
No matter how many times we rebooted our love over and over...

109
00:15:18,060 --> 00:15:20,940
ちょっとだって変われなどしないよ
It won't change even a little bit.

110
00:15:20,940 --> 00:15:25,580
何度愛を再起動したって ちょっとだって変われなどしないよ
No matter how many times we rebooted our love, it won't change even a little bit.

111
00:15:41,996 --> 00:15:46,496
ホロライブでラプラスさんの影が薄いというお話なんですが
There's talk that Laplus-san has a weak presence in hololive...

112
00:15:46,136 --> 00:15:47,036
いや、納得できないね
Hey, I can't accept that!

113
00:15:47,836 --> 00:15:51,536
Q ラプラスさんの魅力は？
Q: What is Laplus-san's charm?

114
00:15:50,936 --> 00:15:52,576
ないんだな、それが
Turns out, she doesn't have any!

115
00:16:20,147 --> 00:16:25,127
「どうもこんにちは 君の分身です」 何の冗談か 目を擦ってみる
"Hello there, I am your doppelganger." What kind of joke is this? I rub my eyes.

116
00:16:25,127 --> 00:16:29,027
影が二つ伸びて そしてまた幕は上がる
Two shadows stretch out, and the curtain rises once again.

117
00:16:30,367 --> 00:16:34,927
「もう一人自分が居たらとあなたは言いました」 「そんな真摯な願いが僕を呼んだのさ」
"You said you wished you had another self." "And that sincere wish called me forth."

118
00:16:35,347 --> 00:16:39,147
そりゃ願ったとも 艱難辛苦全ての代行者
Of course I wished for it, proxy for all trials and tribulations.

119
00:16:41,167 --> 00:16:48,387
過程はいいから結果を下さい 無意味で無意義な代償 ねえこんな事より大事なことがあるんだよ いいだろ
Give me results, never mind the process—meaningless and pointless compensation. Hey, there's something more important than this, isn't there?

120
00:16:48,607 --> 00:16:52,507
「ええやりますやります何でもやります 僕は君の分身です」
"Yeah, I'll do it, I'll do anything! I am your doppelganger."

121
00:16:53,327 --> 00:17:02,347
拝啓ドッペルゲンガー 君は 君は誰？ 嗚呼 混濁と交差して 僕は誰？ ねえ有りもしない 0と1 証明の根拠なんて何処にも
Dear Doppelganger, who are you? Ah, intersecting in confusion, who am I? Hey, zeros and ones that don't even exist, there's no basis for proof anywhere.

122
00:17:04,307 --> 00:17:08,547
拝啓ドッペルゲンガー 誰は 誰は君？ 蝕まれた存在に 世界は気付かないね
Dear Doppelganger, who is you? The world doesn't notice the tainted existence.

123
00:17:09,147 --> 00:17:14,647
鳴り止まない 醒め止まない奇跡の輪廻が 狂った正解を染め上げてルンパッパ
The unceasing, unending cycle of miracles dyes the warped correct answer—Rumpappa!

124
00:17:36,445 --> 00:17:42,825
どうも様子がおかしい月曜日 一つ二つと崩れゆく辻褄が 僕を猜疑する
Monday is acting rather strange. Inconsistencies collapsing one by one make me suspicious of myself:

125
00:17:43,105 --> 00:17:45,365
「お前は一体誰だ」と
"Who on earth are you?"

126
00:17:46,765 --> 00:17:51,645
ちょっと待って 知らない昨日 知りもしない言葉 そうやっていつの間にやら 影は溶けゆく
Wait a second, yesterdays I don't know, words I've never known. Before you know it, the shadow melts away.

127
00:17:52,145 --> 00:17:55,725
僕は何なんだろう ねえどうか存在を返して
What am I? Hey, please give my existence back.

128
00:17:57,645 --> 00:18:04,925
「生憎様だがこっちはこっちで随分心地が良くて」 「もうあなたの居場所は此処にはない事分かってるんでしょ」
"Too bad for you, but it's pretty comfortable over here." "You already know your place is no longer here, don't you?"

129
00:18:05,145 --> 00:18:08,405
「ねえ奪われたんなら奪えばいいだろ 今度はお前の番だから」 含み笑いで侵略者は謂う
"Hey, if it was stolen, just steal it back! Next time, it's your turn." The invader says with a smirk.

130
00:18:09,065 --> 00:18:18,445
拝啓ドッペルゲンガー 君は 君は誰？ 嗚呼 混濁と交差して 僕は誰？ まあ そりゃそうか そうだよな 命の椅子は一つだけ
Dear Doppelganger, who are you? Ah, intersecting in confusion, who am I? Well, of course, that's right—there is only one chair of life.

131
00:18:19,485 --> 00:18:24,805
拝啓ドッペルゲンガー 誰は 誰は君？ 零れ落ちた一粒 乾き果てる前に 誰でもいい 何でもいい 器を下さい
Dear Doppelganger, who is you? Before a fallen droplet dries up completely, anyone is fine, anything is fine—give me a vessel!

132
00:18:28,185 --> 00:18:31,445
狂った正解が染め上げてルンパッパ
The warped correct answer dyes it—Rumpappa!

133
00:18:53,109 --> 00:19:05,189
委ねあって許しあって 満たされ往く 欠けたピース 無価値のペイン 冀望また愛も 託し合って生まれ替わるイニシエイション 「ボスのほうがちゃんと君を生きてやるから」 「君も次の誰か ちゃんと救わなくちゃ」
Yielding and forgiving one another, becoming fulfilled. Missing pieces, worthless pain, hope and love too. Entrusting each other and being reborn in initiation. "Since the boss will live your life properly, you must properly save someone next too."

134
00:19:05,649 --> 00:19:09,029
「もう分かってんだろ 何をすればいいかさ」
"You already know what to do, come on!"

135
00:19:09,989 --> 00:19:22,069
どうか誰か僕に奇跡をくれよ
Please, someone give me a miracle...

136
00:19:29,029 --> 00:19:36,449
「拝啓ドッペルゲンガー 君は 君は誰？」 嗚呼 混濁と交差して 僕は誰？ もう止まらない 戻れない
"Dear Doppelganger, who are you?" Ah, intersecting in confusion, who am I? There's no stopping or turning back anymore.

137
00:19:37,089 --> 00:19:46,889
どうもこんにちは 君の分身です 拝啓ドッペルゲンガー それは それは僕 蝕まれた存在に 世界が気付こうが
Hello there, I am your doppelganger. Dear Doppelganger, that is... that is me. Even if the world notices the tainted existence,

138
00:19:47,409 --> 00:19:52,509
もう鳴り止まない 醒め止まない奇跡の輪廻が 狂った正解を染め上げるさ
The unceasing, unending cycle of miracles dyes the warped correct answer—

139
00:19:52,509 --> 00:20:00,032
上手くやれよ ルンパッパ
Do it well now, Rumpapa!

140
00:20:13,464 --> 00:20:15,564
どうもこんにちは君の分身です
Hello, I'm your alter ego.

141
00:20:28,132 --> 00:20:30,232
ウェーイ！
Hey!

142
00:20:35,132 --> 00:20:37,232
ウェーイ！
Hey!

143
00:21:00,782 --> 00:21:10,032
横縞纏う 囚人ファム・ファタール 有象無象搾り Juiceを呷る 夜な夜な酔な 火遊びで 縊死する
Wearing horizontal stripes, a prisoner femme fatale... Squeezing the masses and gulping down juice, night after night, getting drunk and hanging oneself in a dangerous game.

144
00:21:10,032 --> 00:21:13,232
女児の蝋が溶ける頃
As the girl's wax melts away.

145
00:21:13,232 --> 00:21:19,132
違和感が残業している 空空が寂寂している 淡々とさ こうべ垂れた末に はい論破って
A sense of incongruity is working overtime, the skies are desolate... After casually hanging our heads, it's just 'Ha, debate debunked.'

146
00:21:19,132 --> 00:21:25,032
乾坤一擲 サレンダー 御利口 離合 利己的に ポジよりネガを誑す
A desperate, all-or-nothing surrender... Obedient, parting ways, selfishly luring negatives over positives.

147
00:21:25,032 --> 00:21:30,532
上っ面な愛を愛と呼べんなら 如何せん僕はフールみたい
If superficial love can be called love, then somehow, I must look like a fool.

148
00:21:30,532 --> 00:21:37,032
『話したいこともない』って言うから そこで護身だと気付いたの
You said, 'There's nothing I want to talk about,' and that's when I realized it was just self-defense.

149
00:21:37,032 --> 00:21:43,032
上っ面な君を肯定したんなら 僕の立つ瀬とは何処へやら
If I affirmed your superficial self, where on earth would I stand?

150
00:21:43,032 --> 00:21:49,032
焦れったい玻璃とファンデーション 舌を曝け出してさ まるで犬
Irritating glass and foundation, baring my tongue... just like a dog.

151
00:22:00,782 --> 00:22:10,032
邪 纏う衆人ファム・ファタール 有象無象絞り Deuceを煽る 様な夜な夜な 火遊びで 意志スルー
Wearing evil, a crowd of femme fatales... Squeezing the masses, stoking Deuce, night after night, bypassing will in a dangerous game.

152
00:22:10,032 --> 00:22:13,232
情事の牢が解ける頃
As the prison of our affair unlocks.

153
00:22:13,232 --> 00:22:19,032
自称・天秤はお頭が軽い方に軍杯を上げた
The self-proclaimed scale tipped its judgment toward the empty-headed.

154
00:22:19,032 --> 00:22:25,032
デキャンタに移した程度にしか思ってない 布石をいけず石のように置いた馬鹿
Thinking of it only as something poured into a decanter, I'm a fool who placed strategic stones like spiteful ones.

155
00:22:25,032 --> 00:22:30,532
上っ面な愛を愛と呼べんなら 如何せん僕はフールみたい
If superficial love can be called love, then somehow, I must look like a fool.

156
00:22:30,532 --> 00:22:37,032
『離したいワケがない』って言うけど 気付かないワケも無いんだよな
You say, 'There's no way I want to let go,' but there's no way I wouldn't notice, right?

157
00:22:37,032 --> 00:22:43,032
上っ面な僕の存在理由はさ お誂え向きな隘路 贄
The reason for my superficial existence is a tailor-made bottleneck, a sacrifice.

158
00:22:43,032 --> 00:22:49,032
ブランデー肌で吸ったなら しどろもどろになって戯れて
If I soaked it in brandy skin, stumbling and stammering, I'd frolic away.

159
00:23:13,032 --> 00:23:25,032
ほさそそお お お お...
Ho-sa-so-so-oh-oh-oh...

160
00:23:25,032 --> 00:23:31,032
上っ面な愛を愛と呼べんなら 如何せん僕はフールみたい
If superficial love can be called love, then somehow, I must look like a fool.

161
00:23:31,032 --> 00:23:37,032
『話せないこともない』って言うから そこで誤審だと気付いたの
You said, 'It's not like we can't talk,' and that's when I realized it was a misjudgment.

162
00:23:37,032 --> 00:23:43,032
上っ面な愛を愛と呼ぶんなら 如何せん僕がヒールみたい
If superficial love is called love, then somehow, I look like the villain.

163
00:23:43,032 --> 00:23:49,032
お別れのキスも何杯目 邪 見透かされて まるで犬
How many farewell kisses have there been? Evil is seen right through, just like a dog.

164
00:23:49,032 --> 00:23:56,032
まるで犬さ
Just like a dog.

165
00:24:01,032 --> 00:24:14,032
ほさそそお お お お...
Ho-sa-so-so-oh-oh-oh...

166
00:24:22,132 --> 00:24:25,232
てかさ、スタジオ寒いんだよ。
I mean, the studio is freezing, you know.

167
00:24:26,532 --> 00:24:30,832
ずっと…寒すぎんだよ、この、このスタジオ、カバーのスタジオは。
It's just... way too cold, this, this studio, the Cover studio is.

168
00:24:31,532 --> 00:24:34,532
え？ てか、意味がわからない。ふざけ上がって。
Huh? I mean, I don't get it. Messing around with me.

169
00:24:36,532 --> 00:24:38,532
はっ…
Ha...

170
00:24:48,232 --> 00:24:52,232
てめえか！ てめえかよ！ え、その腐った根性、笑ったね。
Was it you?! You're the one?! Heh, that rotten attitude of yours, made you laugh, huh.

171
00:24:54,032 --> 00:24:59,832
その心笑ってるね。悪いけどね、あんたよりよっぽど生きてるんだよ。悪い？
Your heart's laughing, huh. Too bad, I'm living way more than you are. Got a problem with that?

172
00:25:00,080 --> 00:25:01,360
がはは！
Gahaha!

173
00:25:01,360 --> 00:25:04,180
もっと行きたいんだよ！
I want to go even further!

174
00:25:04,180 --> 00:25:05,160
おい！
Hey!

175
00:25:05,160 --> 00:25:07,500
最後までちゃんと見るって言って！
I told you to watch it all the way to the end!

176
00:25:07,860 --> 00:25:11,460
はい最後までちゃんと見るって言って！
Yes, I said watch it all the way to the end!

177
00:25:11,700 --> 00:25:13,240
あーー！
Aaaah!

178
00:25:23,223 --> 00:25:32,443
僕がずっと前から思ってる事を話そうか 友達に戻れたらこれ以上はもう望まないさ
Shall I tell you what I've been thinking for so long? If we could go back to being friends, I wouldn't ask for anything more than this.

179
00:25:32,443 --> 00:25:37,403
君がそれでいいなら僕だってそれで構わないさ
If you're fine with that, then I don't mind either.

180
00:25:37,403 --> 00:25:43,123
嘘つきの僕が吐いたはんたいことばの愛のうた
A love song of contradictory words uttered by a liar like me.

181
00:26:01,240 --> 00:26:06,040
今日はこっちの地方はどしゃぶりの晴天でした
Today in this region, it was pouring sunshine.

182
00:26:06,040 --> 00:26:10,880
昨日もずっと暇で一日満喫してました
Yesterday was boring all day too, and I spent the whole day chilling out.

183
00:26:10,880 --> 00:26:16,120
別に君のことなんて考えてなんかいないさ
It's not like I was thinking about you or anything.

184
00:26:16,120 --> 00:26:21,040
いやでもちょっと本当は考えてたかもなんて
Or rather, maybe I was actually thinking about you a bit... or something like that.

185
00:26:21,040 --> 00:26:24,360
メリーゴーランドみたいに回る
Spinning around like a merry-go-round,

186
00:26:24,360 --> 00:26:27,800
僕の頭ん中はもうグルグルさ
My head is already going round and round.

187
00:26:27,800 --> 00:26:34,340
この両手から零れそうなほど君に貰った愛はどこに捨てよう？
Where should I throw away the love you gave me, so much that it's spilling from these hands?

188
00:26:34,340 --> 00:26:42,540
限りのある消耗品なんて僕は
I don't need limited consumable things like that.

189
00:26:42,540 --> 00:26:47,420
要らないよ
I don't need them.

190
00:26:47,420 --> 00:26:52,240
僕がずっと前から思ってる事を話そうか
Shall I tell you what I've been thinking for so long?

191
00:26:52,240 --> 00:26:56,920
姿は見えないのに言葉だけ見えちゃってるんだ
Though I can't see your figure, only your words are visible.

192
00:26:56,920 --> 00:27:01,420
僕が知らないことがあるだけで気が狂いそうだ
Just knowing there are things I don't know drives me crazy.

193
00:27:01,420 --> 00:27:06,880
ぶら下がった感情が 綺麗なのか汚いのか
Whether these hanging emotions are beautiful or dirty,

194
00:27:06,880 --> 00:27:11,000
僕にはまだわからず
I still don't understand

195
00:27:11,000 --> 00:27:16,160
捨てる宛てもないんだ
and have nowhere to throw them away.

196
00:27:16,160 --> 00:27:20,560
言葉の裏の裏が見えるまで待つからさ
I'll wait until I can see the reverse of the reverse of your words.

197
00:27:20,560 --> 00:27:24,880
待つくらいならいいじゃないか
Isn't it fine to at least wait?

198
00:27:24,880 --> 00:27:31,320
進む君と止まった僕の 縮まらない隙を何で埋めよう？
How should I fill the unclosing gap between you who move forward and me who stopped?

199
00:27:31,320 --> 00:27:41,040
まだ素直に言葉に出来ない僕は 天性の弱虫さ
I'm still a cowardly person who can't honestly put it into words.

200
00:28:40,400 --> 00:28:42,760
もう離さない
I won't let go anymore.

201
00:28:42,760 --> 00:28:46,440
君がすべてさ
You are everything.

202
00:28:46,440 --> 00:28:50,040
BE MY BABY

203
00:28:50,040 --> 00:28:54,040
BE MY BABY

204
00:28:55,360 --> 00:28:58,780
もう離さない
I won't let go anymore.

205
00:28:58,780 --> 00:29:02,200
君がすべてさ
You are everything.

206
00:29:03,520 --> 00:29:05,140
エノキさんが歌って
Enoki-san is singing!

207
00:29:07,760 --> 00:29:11,240
もう離さない
I won't let go anymore.

208
00:29:11,240 --> 00:29:14,720
君がすべてさ
You are everything.

209
00:29:14,720 --> 00:29:18,480
BE MY BABY

210
00:29:18,480 --> 00:29:22,080
BE MY BABY

211
00:30:01,096 --> 00:30:03,276
ほらほらまた始まった
Hey, hey, it's starting up again...

212
00:30:03,276 --> 00:30:06,236
お得意の自己弁護
Your favorite self-justifying defense.

213
00:30:06,236 --> 00:30:07,796
言い訳「でもね」
Excuses like "But you know..."

214
00:30:07,796 --> 00:30:10,636
「だって」
and "Because..."

215
00:30:12,836 --> 00:30:15,056
ほらほらまた始まった
Hey, hey, it's starting up again...

216
00:30:15,056 --> 00:30:19,396
ごめん！からのKissのパターンって感じ？
That "sorry followed by a kiss" pattern... feeling easygoing?

217
00:30:24,416 --> 00:30:30,196
“いつかアタシだけ”そんな夢見たこともあったけど
"Someday, just me..." There were times I dreamt of a dream like that, but...

218
00:30:30,196 --> 00:30:34,476
寂しい時だけ電話して もううんざりだわ！
Calling only when you're lonely—I'm already sick of it!

219
00:30:36,756 --> 00:30:39,176
全然アタシに興味ないじゃん
You're not interested in me at all, are you?

220
00:30:39,176 --> 00:30:42,556
キミが好きなのは自分でしょ
What you like is yourself, right?

221
00:30:43,136 --> 00:30:47,576
やっぱりアタシに興味ないじゃん その話もう聞き飽きたわ
As I thought, you're not interested in me at all. I'm sick of hearing that story already!

222
00:30:49,056 --> 00:30:53,356
そもそもだいたいアタシに興味ないじゃん そーやってまた誤魔化して…
In the first place, you're generally not interested in me at all, brushing it off like that again...

223
00:30:54,736 --> 00:30:58,376
Be My Boy わがまますぎるBaby
Be My Boy, way too selfish Baby!

224
00:30:59,096 --> 00:31:04,476
抱きしめてよね！
Hold me close, won't you!

225
00:31:06,996 --> 00:31:12,496
ホントキミは しょーもないな 甘いアタシ 「しょーがないな」 泣いたって 行かないでって 言ったって 変わりゃしないや！
You really are hopeless. Sweet me saying "It can't be helped." Crying, saying "Don't go," saying that won't change a thing!

226
00:31:13,248 --> 00:31:17,428
もう少しだけならまぁ 踊ってもいいかもな とろけて とけてイキたいの
If it's just a little bit more, well, maybe dancing is fine. I want to melt, melting away.

227
00:31:19,048 --> 00:31:23,588
どんなアピールも意味ないし 気づいてくれないけど
No amount of appeal means a thing, and you still don't notice, but...

228
00:31:24,128 --> 00:31:28,508
アタシが寂しい時だって 逢いにきて！
Come see me even when I'm feeling lonely!

229
00:31:30,608 --> 00:31:35,368
全然アタシに興味ないじゃん どこがダメなの？ 教えてよ
You're not interested in me at all, are you? Where am I going wrong? Tell me!

230
00:31:36,728 --> 00:31:41,268
やっぱりアタシに興味ないじゃん 携帯ばかりいじってさ
As I thought, you're not interested in me at all, just messing with your phone...

231
00:31:42,868 --> 00:31:48,408
そもそもだいたいアタシに興味ないじゃん 少しくらい期待させて (もう…)
In the first place, you're generally not interested in me at all. At least let me get my hopes up a little (Geez...)

232
00:31:49,168 --> 00:31:53,688
Lonely Girl 独り占めてよBaby
Lonely Girl, keep me all to yourself, Baby!

233
00:31:54,448 --> 00:32:00,648
振り回さないで！
Don't push me around!

234
00:32:06,708 --> 00:32:11,488
ねぇ？ Maybe Melty? ワン・ツー Shall We Dance? 踊りましょ
Hey? Maybe Melty? One, Two, Shall We Dance? Let's dance!

235
00:32:12,228 --> 00:32:17,668
はやく 手と手 繋いで 最後にひとつだけ
Quickly hold hands, and just one last thing...

236
00:32:18,548 --> 00:32:21,608
溺れるくらい愛してよ
Love me until you drown in it!

237
00:32:22,128 --> 00:32:26,588
全然アタシに興味ないじゃん キミが好きなのは自分でしょ
You're not interested in me at all, are you? What you like is yourself, right?

238
00:32:27,508 --> 00:32:32,488
やっぱりアタシに興味ないじゃん その話もう聞き飽きたわ
As I thought, you're not interested in me at all. I'm sick of hearing that story already!

239
00:32:33,668 --> 00:32:38,328
そもそもだいたいアタシに興味ないじゃん そーやってまた誤魔化して…
